{"id":874,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为持续深化共青团“伙伴计划”常态化关爱服务，充分发挥航空宇航专业育人优势，持续夯实青少年本土红色教育根基，7 月 16 日，中北大学航空宇航学院“航心映红岚”暑期社会实践队于岢岚县广惠园社区服务站点开展第四天支教活动，开设航空科普实践、本土红色文化宣讲特色课堂，持续以多元教学形式丰富青少年暑期生活，稳步推进科学普及与红色思想教育走深走实。</p><p>纸上造飞机，户外逐长空，纸飞机科普教学如期开展。实践队员结合航空专业基础理论，围绕升力、空气阻力等知识点进行讲解，现场演示多种纸飞机折叠方式，将专业理论转化为通俗化教学内容。理论教学完成后，实践队员组织小朋友们前往户外场地举办纸飞机竞赛活动。学生独立完成纸飞机折叠与调试，分组开展试飞比拼，在实操过程中巩固课堂所学航空知识，在欢笑声中培养航宇兴趣。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lnz6rkozlYMNU8LIzrfMRLsMzW2Ulr52LNLZMNVVUl-PMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyanSyaokyDL4CZnRNaUzUPnzfVL4LsLzv8U4GDMmf7Um6FU4GsnmCaU8nFL4WknmUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM47sgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11717&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/40E086368D90A41E0E337174C0660DB7/C07F60CD/32BF4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lnz6rkozlYMNU8LIzrfMRLsMzW2Ulr52LNLZMNVVUl-PMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyanSyaokyDL4CZnRNaUzUPnzfVL4LsLzv8U4GDMmf7Um6FU4GsnmCaU8nFL4WknmUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM47sgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11717&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLm7rDozUPLmfRMI8LDMRf2M4nVL8U5DnR9PL494L8lPo7U0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDoSyinSyaM4CYUzrfMmfkoRGbU8CPU8VkMNM7M8Q2UzQFU8V7Uz9DL7rFL4WknmUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM47sgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11717&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9695E0762A5A60B809CF1CAB6CD7FFA6/CADA860E/32BF4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLm7rDozUPLmfRMI8LDMRf2M4nVL8U5DnR9PL494L8lPo7U0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDoSyinSyaM4CYUzrfMmfkoRGbU8CPU8VkMNM7M8Q2UzQFU8V7Uz9DL7rFL4WknmUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM47sgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11717&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lM4CrYL4liU8CiUINn2U4UaolWkLzn52M8WfL4viL7-iUzU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhVLkysoShRLRTfLmn7ollPUm6fozUsMllDMlUYL8rVMNVFnmARMN74n7QFL4WknmUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM47sgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11717&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3E079C09A24D9E1B7A9475E65D23EE6A/F8C6A3DF/32BF4\" v