vsl/86076E81C384D44BB3B9055A64D9F79F/9EE0C389/2B804\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLzMrfMmUaLmfknIzlboRv4oR9YLRU5ZMmCaLlnfMzWfLml0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDLkysM1hVoRVRL498nRU8UN-4UmNaMzrfMmn7olCsolQFolrVL7L4oRTFLN-ZLRUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM47sgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11717&e=.png\"></p><p>本次第四日支教活动依托社区“伙伴计划”服务阵地，整合航空科普实践、户外文体活动、红色思政教育、课业辅导多项服务内容。后续实践队将持续发挥专业特色，深度挖掘岢岚本地红色资源，按既定计划持续开展标准化、多元化社区公益教学服务。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lnz6rkozlYMNU8LIzrfMRLsMzW2Ulr52LNLZMNVVUl-PMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyanSyaokyDL4CZnRNaUzUPnzfVL4LsLzv8U4GDMmf7Um6FU4GsnmCaU8nFL4WknmUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM47sgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11717&e=.png"}